s with Robert\u2019s Blazing Barrels or turn them against each other with Maria\u2019s Psych Strike, you\u2019ll hold your own in the Hostile Lands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus every character has a passive buff so if you want a little extra speed to dodge bullets or some extra health to absorb them, we got you covered!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/85152f59a2af6f7fa67e80ddf96ddd30.webp?t=1747926077\" width=620 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/0c3c1f27d3813bde4156326e31e0eaab.poster.avif?t=1747926077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/0c3c1f27d3813bde4156326e31e0eaab.webm?t=1747926077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Some Hostile Variety!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with its own theme, enemies, bosses and loot will guarantee a new experience every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/c55b6138c63fb4fdcc43f6772b0ae332.webp?t=1747926077\" width=620 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/d9fdf6cc3ce1fa36405df2776b9e5b3a.avif?t=1747926077\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Feel the Power!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run you\u2019ll gain \u20